  "description": "Experience the future of biking with the Juggernaut XD Duo - Step Through electric bike. Engineered for performance, comfort, and style, this eBike is your ticket to effortless and exhilarating rides.\nFeatures:\n\nPowerful Motor: Equipped with a 2300W Biktrix XD Coaxial Drive Motor for unparalleled performance.\n\nSpeed and Torque: Reaches speeds up to 65 km/h with 85Nm torque for an exhilarating ride.\n\nRobust Load Capacity: Supports up to 330 lbs, providing stability and reliability for every journey.\n\nStep-Through Frame: Offers easy access and seamless mounting/dismounting for maximum comfort.\n\nTwo Frame Options: Choose between 16\" medium or 18\" large for a personalized ride.\n\nSafety Features: Includes Armageddon Headlight for a powerful beam and Front/Rear Fenders for protection from the elements.\n\nIntuitive Controls: Torque Sensor and Low-Profile RH Twist Throttle for smooth pedal assistance and seamless acceleration.\n\nVersatile Wheelset Options: Choose between 26x4 for stability or 27.5x3 for agility.\n\nComfortable Saddle: Wide Spring-Supported Comfort Saddle for plush support on every journey.\n\nBenefits:\n\nExperience unparalleled performance with the powerful motor and precise torque.\nEnjoy the convenience of easy access and comfortable mounting/dismounting with the Step-Through Frame.\nPersonalize your ride with two frame options to suit your preferences.\nStay safe with powerful lighting and protection from the elements.\nEffortlessly accelerate and enjoy smooth pedal assistance with intuitive controls.\nChoose the wheelset that matches your riding style for stability or agility.\nExperience luxurious comfort with the plush support of the Wide Spring-Supported Comfort Saddle.\n\nEmbrace the future of biking with the Juggernaut XD Duo - Step Through electric bike. Elevate your ride and make every journey an adventure.",
